# Day 20 - Anchor Tags and Hover Effects

## 📚 Learning Objectives

* Learned how anchor tags work.
* Learned how to create links.
* Learned how to add hover effects using CSS.

## HTML Tags Learned

### Anchor Tag

```html
<a></a>
```

Used to create hyperlinks.

## Anchor Attributes

### href

Specifies where the link goes.

Example:

```html
<a href="https://github.com">
    GitHub
</a>
```

### target="_blank"

Opens the link in a new tab.

## New CSS Concept

### Hover

```css
a:hover{

    color:red;

}
```

Changes the color when the mouse moves over the link.

## Practical Work

* Created email, GitHub and LinkedIn links.
* Added a hover effect.

## Key Takeaways

* Anchor tags create hyperlinks.
* href specifies the destination.
* Hover effects improve user experience.
